    {
     "t": "h2",
     "html": "Craft Kitchen &amp; Dispensary"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "Being part of the Allston-Brighton community and Boston Landing means being a part of a community that’s bursting with culture, creativity, health and wellness. Whether you’re a local, student, athlete, artist or in town catching a show this community welcomes you. It’s high time you feel at home!"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "CastleLeaf Cannabis, located at <a href=\"/directions/\">100 Leo M Birmingham Parkway in Brighton, MA 02135</a>, is your premier destination for top-quality cannabis products in the area. Whether you’re searching for a “dispensary near me” or simply the “best cannabis dispensary” in Brighton, CastleLeaf has everything you need for a great experience."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "At CastleLeaf, customer experience is our top priority. Our knowledgeable and friendly staff are always available to answer questions, offer personalized recommendations, and ensure every visit is a positive one. We believe that finding the right cannabis should be simple, enjoyable, and educational, which is why we’ve designed a dispensary experience tailored to your preferences."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "Located conveniently in Brighton, our dispensary is easy to find and provides ample parking, making your visit as hassle-free as possible. CastleLeaf Cannabis is committed to compliance, quality, and offering the best cannabis experience in the area. When you’re looking for a top-tier “marijuana dispensary” in Brighton, CastleLeaf Cannabis is your go-to source."
    },
    {
     "t": "grid",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "t": "details",
       "summary": "What do I need to know about being an Adult-Use (recreational) customer?",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "p",
         "html": "You’ve come to the right place. If you still have questions, stop by and chat with one of our bud tenders or give us a call. But if you’re ready to roll (a joint, for example…) you can make a purchase right here on the site."
        },
        {
         "t": "ul",
         "items": [
          "<a href=\"/menu/\">Order Online</a> (pick-up in-store or Home Delivery)",
          "Walk-in Express (in-store kiosk)",
          "In-store Budtender Experience"
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "details",
       "summary": "What are your store hours?",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "p",
         "html": "For starters, CastleLeaf is an Adult-Use only retail provider. That said, we strive to educate adult-use consumers about the therapeutic benefits of cannabis."
        },
        {
         "t": "p",
         "html": "Adult use (recreational) consumers can shop at any adult-use dispensary with a valid government ID that shows they are 21+, can purchase up to 1oz per day, and edibles are capped at 5mg per serving and 100mg per package."
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "details",
       "summary": "What form of payment do you accept?",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "p",
         "html": "Yes! Anyone 21+ with a valid government ID can make a purchase including out of state."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
